==English==

===Etymology===
From [[Ancient Greek]] prefix [[παλαιο-]] "[[paleo-]]", from [[παλαιός]] (''palaios'') "old".

===Alternative spellings===
* [[pale-]]
* [[palaeo-]]
* [[palae-]]

===Prefix===
{{infl|en|prefix|cat=prefixes}}

# very old; [[prehistoric]]
# very early; [[primitive]]
# related to [[paleontology]]

